@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@patientToken = replace-with-patient-token-after-first-password-change

### Completed tests of this authenticated patient; may arrive before examination completion
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/lab/mine?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Scope injection must return 400
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/lab/mine?patientId=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
